+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/KMFD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Diorite, granodiorite and tonalite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Ludlow Epoch (Silurian Period) - to - Early Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (426.7-394.3 Ma BP)."@en .
+<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/LEAT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granite. Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Wenlock Epoch (Silurian Period) - to - Early Devonian Epoch (Devonian Period) (432.9-394.3 Ma BP)."@en .
